---
// "Meet your procurement officer." The guide-authority payoff to the insulin
// parable: the abstract promise (someone independent does the exam and buys
// for you) becomes a concrete person with an unimpeachable record. Ends on a
// transitional CTA so a convinced reader can book before the mechanism act.
//
// PLACEHOLDER credential wording below: confirm Cliff's exact Sandia language
// before publishing. He was the sole source they trusted for all technologies
// under DOD/DOE oversight; swap in his precise phrasing if it differs.
---

<section class="section proc" id="procurement" aria-labelledby="proc-title">
  <div class="container container--narrow">
    <div class="proc__inner reveal">
      <p class="proc__kicker">The exam needs an examiner</p>
      <h2 class="proc__title" id="proc-title">Meet your procurement officer.</h2>

      <p class="proc__body">
        Every dollar of equipment your building needs, someone buys it for you.
        That someone is <strong>Cliff Suljak</strong>, the sole source Sandia
        National Laboratories trusted for every technology, under Department of
        Defense and Department of Energy oversight, where buying the wrong thing
        was never an option. He ran more than $600&nbsp;million in projects at
        the Salt River Project. Now he runs the exam on your building and buys
        on your behalf.
      </p>
      <p class="proc__body">
        The people who can't afford to be sold the wrong box don't let a vendor
        decide. Neither should you.
      </p>

      <p class="proc__refrain">That's the whole idea.</p>

      <div class="proc__cta">
        <a href="#book" class="btn">
          Book a verified pilot
          <span class="btn__arrow" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
        </a>
        <a href="#power" class="proc__more">
          or keep reading to see what the exam finds
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .proc {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    background:
      radial-gradient(
        ellipse 50% 50% at 12% 0%,
        rgba(194, 163, 104, 0.06),
        transparent 70%
      ),
      var(--bg);
  }
  .proc__kicker {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--gold-text);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-s);
  }
  .proc__title {
    font-size: var(--step-3);
    max-width: 18ch;
  }
  .proc__body {
    margin-top: var(--space-m);
    font-size: var(--step-1);
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--body);
    max-width: 60ch;
  }
  .proc__body strong {
    color: var(--ink);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .proc__refrain {
    margin-top: var(--space-l);
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: var(--step-2);
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: var(--gold-text);
  }
  .proc__cta {
    margin-top: var(--space-l);
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-m);
  }
  .proc__more {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: var(--step-0);
    color: var(--muted);
    border-bottom: 1px dotted var(--line-strong);
    padding-bottom: 1px;
    transition: color 0.3s ease, border-color 0.3s ease;
  }
  .proc__more:hover {
    color: var(--gold-text);
    border-color: var(--gold-text);
  }
</style>
